This article lists all features that are currently unimplemented in the mobile version. It does not include features that were once in the game but were eventually removed (such as [[Serial Codes]]).

==Chicken Cat==
[[Chicken Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Chicken Cat]] was an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was part of a scrapped collaboration with Nobe_tto (のべぇ〜っと), creator of "[https://store.line.me/stickershop/product/1033821/en Life of Chicken and Chicks]". It was never obtainable through any means, and was eventually removed altogether in [[Version 8.7 Update|Version 8.7]].

