==Cheetah Cat==
[[Cheetah Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Cheetah Cat]] is an Uber Rare Cat added in [[Version 11.7 Update|Version 11.7]], with useless stats and no evolution. It appears to be a cheetah with a [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Cat]] face and a ball chained to one of its legs, and its Japanese name is Neko Chītā (ネコチーター), which can be translated as either "Cheetah Cat" or "Cheater Cat". Since it can only be obtained by ''cheating'', that may in fact be the joke.

