==Super Rare Cat from Stories of Legend==
From [[The Battle Cats|BCEN]] 3.5.0 to [[Version 5.0 Update|5.0]], there was unused text meant for a preview of a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] dropped from the final [[Stories of Legend]] stage, formatted as: "Stories of Legend Clear Reward|Clear the Stories of Legend for a|chance to get the Super Rare unit |●●●●●●●!"

Note that at the time, [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Wolf]] and [[Li'l Nyandam (Special Cat)|Li'l Nyandam]] were the only drop units from Stories of Legend. Ultimately, [[Mecha-Bun (Special Cat)|Mecha-Bun]] does not have its own preview, is a [[:Category:Mythic Cats|Mythic Cat]] rather than Super Rare, and is a guaranteed reward, not chance-based.

