==Enemy IDs 564 to 569==
Enemies [[E-564]], [[E-565]], [[E-566]], [[E-567]], [[E-568]] and [[E-569]] share [[Doge]]'s stats, sprites and animations, but are traited as [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]]. Since these IDs come right after [[Wicked Cat (Enemy)|Wicked Cat]], [[Wicked Tank Cat (Enemy)|Wicked Tank Cat]] and [[Wicked Axe Cat (Enemy)|Wicked Axe Cat]], it appears that they are stand-ins for Wicked versions of the other six [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]].

