==Attack Count Stat==
A stat used by units with the [[Kamikaze]] ability that limits the amount of attacks they can use. On said units, it's required for the ability to function, and causes them to be defeated after attacking a set amount of times. The stat itself is always set to 1 for those units, but having one with a higher value causes them to only perish after attacking that amount of times.

If a unit without Kamikaze has this stat specified, they will not die after executing the set amount of attacks, instead remaining permanently in their idle animation for the rest of the level. This behavior could be seen in-game in the [[Version 10.4 Update]] by using [[Sniper the Cat]] to interrupt [[Wafer Cat XL (Enemy)|Wafer Cat XL]]'s attack animation, though was immediately patched out in the Version 10.4.1 Update.

