==Unused Enemy Abilities==
====Immune to Damage====
In the files for the [[Enemy Guide]], there is an unused description for an ability that likely makes an enemy completely immune to damage, as the name implies. The ability has no icon in the files, isn't used by any enemy, and is not the same as Dodge Attack. The exact version it was added in is unknown, but it is placed before Toxic, which indicates it was before [[Version 9.1 Update|Version 9.1]]. In the [[Cat Guide]], the text is replaced by a placeholder.

:''【Immune to Damage】<br>This enemy does not take attack damage.''

