==Traitless Talent Orbs==
Although [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemies do not have associated [[Talent Orbs]], the game files have had a sprite for them since [[Version 9.7 Update|Version 9.7]]. The sprite for [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] Orbs has also been present since then, but it wasn't until [[Version 13.3 Update|Version 13.3]] that they were actually implemented.

