==Unused Talent Cost==
There's an unused cost for a Talent that maxes out at level 1: 250 NP. It is unknown what this is meant for, as the most expensive non-upgradable Talents are Ultra Talents for [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rares]] at level 60, costing 150 NP.

==Unused Stamp Rewards==
Unused spritesheets for various Stamp Rewards exist within the game's files, ranging from NP, to Catfruit, to engineers for the [[Ototo Corps|Ototo Corps]]. For the English Gold Catfruit stamp in particular, a much brighter design is used instead of the one seen in-game. Some of these do however appear in [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], as rewards for completing certain [[Catnip Challenges]].

