===Effect DOWN Combos===
In addition to "Up (Sm)", "Up (M)", "Up (L)" and "Up (XL)", there is unused [https://www.reddit.com/r/battlecats/comments/4anss5/comment/d11x6gy/ text] for a "DOWN" Combo level. Only said text string remains, no code for it was left over.

==Trivia==
*Although the Warp Resistant ability itself is not assigned to any Cats, Cats with the [[Sage Slayer]] ability still have the Warp Resistant effect. This can be seen if a [[:Category:Sage Slayer Cats|Sage Slayer Cat]] gets warped by [[Techn-Old Hyena]], since they will come back much sooner than a non-Sage Slayer.

